          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Maybe we don’t need to, Delfador. Power is a fragile thing, and we’ve shown this entire city — a city that once fought against Asheviere — that the queen is not so unbeatable as she once seemed. I do not think Isolde will be able to leave Dan’Tonk again without risking its revolt."),
